        {
          "block_id": "p1_para_31",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Treatment-emergent adverse events (TEAEs) are defined as AEs that started after the date/time of study drug administration. AE reported terms were coded using the Medical Dictionary for Regulatory Activities (MedDRA) Version 24.1.",
          "bbox": [
            0.1842,
            4.9624,
            7.6205,
            5.1813
          ],
          "azure_role": null,
          "is_heading": false
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p1_para_32",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Day - Date - Date of Injection (+ 1 if Date >> Date of Injection). Day is calculated only for complete dates.",
          "bbox": [
            0.1903,
            5.1899,
            6.7717,
            5.2967
          ],
          "azure_role": null,
          "is_heading": false
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p1_para_33",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "text": "[1] OD = Ocular dexter (right) ; OS - Ocular sinister (left) ; OU - Both eyes. * indicates study eye.",
          "bbox": [
            0.2059,
            5.3038,
            6.1666,
            5.4102
          ],
          "azure_role": null,
          "is_heading": false
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p1_para_34",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "text": "[2] Serious ?: 1 = Death; 2 - Life-threatening; 3 - Hospitalization (initial or prolonged) ; 4 - Disability or permanent damage; 5 = Congenital anomaly/birth defect; 6 - Other important medical event",
          "bbox": [
            0.1863,
            5.413,
            8.066,
            5.6359
          ],
          "azure_role": null,
          "is_heading": false
        },
        {
          "block_id": "p1_para_35",
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "text": "[3] Outcome: 1 - Recovered or Resolved, 2 - Recovered or Resolved with Sequelae, 3 - Recovering or Resolving, 4 - Not Recovered or Not Resolved, 5 - Fatal, 6 - Unknown.",
          "bbox": [
            0.1838,
            5.64,
            8.3032,
            5.8623
          ],
          "azure_role": null,
          "is_heading": false
        },
